(4908845, 712708, 83650, '<td valign="top">Slightly oof with what looks also to be camera shake.  Probably could have bumped up the contrast and maybe upped the saturation a little too.  Good luck, as I''m guessing the other voters will keep you down in the 4''s.</td>', 'Slightly oof with what looks also to be camera shake.  Probably could have bumped up the contrast and maybe upped the saturation a little too.  Good luck, as I''m guessing the other voters will keep you down in the 4''s.', '2008-08-25 02:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
