(4908851, 713514, 73056, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait - caught at just the right moment.</td>', 'Lovely portrait - caught at just the right moment.', '2008-08-25 02:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908855, 713670, 83650, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tighter crop on the horse and rider to eliminate the logs on the lower left and the flowers at low center.  The shutter speed was perfect though - the splash is nicely frozen.  The vignette caught my attention first though instead of the subject(s).</td>', 'Maybe a tighter crop on the horse and rider to eliminate the logs on the lower left and the flowers at low center.  The shutter speed was perfect though - the splash is nicely frozen.  The vignette caught my attention first though instead of the subject(s).', '2008-08-25 02:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908856, 713587, 3214, '<td valign="top">Way oversharpened IMO as I look at the dirt in particular, you''ve captured a nice moment in the action.</td>', 'Way oversharpened IMO as I look at the dirt in particular, you''ve captured a nice moment in the action.', '2008-08-25 02:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908857, 713734, 3214, '<td valign="top">Always nicer to shoot them without the halter on, but I recognize that you may not have had that choice!</td>', 'Always nicer to shoot them without the halter on, but I recognize that you may not have had that choice!', '2008-08-25 02:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908858, 712783, 83650, '<td valign="top">Good comp.  I was drawn right to his eye first thing.</td>', 'Good comp.  I was drawn right to his eye first thing.', '2008-08-25 02:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908859, 713542, 3214, '<td valign="top">I predict top ten with this nice Icelandic solo!</td>', 'I predict top ten with this nice Icelandic solo!', '2008-08-25 02:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908860, 713725, 3214, '<td valign="top">The lack of shadow detail is probably some kind of statement, too bad, because I love the texture and toning in the rest of it!</td>', 'The lack of shadow detail is probably some kind of statement, too bad, because I love the texture and toning in the rest of it!', '2008-08-25 02:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908861, 713516, 37252, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF, really does a great job of separating the horse from the background. Focus is also right on. Good work!</td>', 'Very nice DOF, really does a great job of separating the horse from the background. Focus is also right on. Good work!', '2008-08-25 02:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908864, 713738, 73056, '<td valign="top">He is a handsome boy! I really like the tone of this.</td>', 'He is a handsome boy! I really like the tone of this.', '2008-08-25 02:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908868, 713637, 73056, '<td valign="top">Now that''s friendship!</td>', 'Now that''s friendship!', '2008-08-25 02:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908869, 713569, 3214, '<td valign="top">Um, varnish roan Appaloosa.  But how were you to know.  Nice grouping and tones!</td>', 'Um, varnish roan Appaloosa.  But how were you to know.  Nice grouping and tones!', '2008-08-25 02:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908872, 713729, 37252, '<td valign="top">Overall, the image seems dark. The sculpture is interesting, but not the most creative perspective here.</td>', 'Overall, the image seems dark. The sculpture is interesting, but not the most creative perspective here.', '2008-08-25 02:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908874, 713503, 73056, '<td valign="top">I like this straight on shot. The minimal background against him works great.</td>', 'I like this straight on shot. The minimal background against him works great.', '2008-08-25 02:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908876, 713507, 37252, '<td valign="top">Yellows seem over saturated here - at least for my liking. I do like the softness in the horses, and the DOF.</td>', 'Yellows seem over saturated here - at least for my liking. I do like the softness in the horses, and the DOF.', '2008-08-25 02:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908877, 712815, 83650, '<td valign="top">I think the frame is cropped a little too close to the rider.  Maybe either crop down right to the horse with a barely recognizable person in the shot, or give a little more freespace surrounding the rider involved.</td>', 'I think the frame is cropped a little too close to the rider.  Maybe either crop down right to the horse with a barely recognizable person in the shot, or give a little more freespace surrounding the rider involved.', '2008-08-25 02:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908878, 713769, 3214, '<td valign="top">Nice asses--Slippy?  Mules are sterile, but it''s fun to imagine them as a nuclear family.</td>', 'Nice asses--Slippy?  Mules are sterile, but it''s fun to imagine them as a nuclear family.', '2008-08-25 02:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908880, 713516, 73056, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2008-08-25 02:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908882, 713525, 3214, '<td valign="top">Very cute, fun shot, and crisp as can be.  Might be back to bump this one!</td>', 'Very cute, fun shot, and crisp as can be.  Might be back to bump this one!', '2008-08-25 02:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908883, 713768, 37252, '<td valign="top">While I appreciate that you were trying to give us a unique perspective, I''m just not sure the fish eye look does well here. I would really like to be able to see the riders face, and a bit more of the horse face too.</td>', 'While I appreciate that you were trying to give us a unique perspective, I''m just not sure the fish eye look does well here. I would really like to be able to see the riders face, and a bit more of the horse face too.', '2008-08-25 02:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908885, 713512, 3214, '<td valign="top">Inventive setup!</td>', 'Inventive setup!', '2008-08-25 02:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908886, 713289, 37252, '<td valign="top">A bit dark in the shadowed side of the face.</td>', 'A bit dark in the shadowed side of the face.', '2008-08-25 02:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908887, 713654, 83650, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Although the male''s rear half and leg pull attention away from the heads(where the attention should be drawn in this case).</td>', 'Great capture!  Although the male''s rear half and leg pull attention away from the heads(where the attention should be drawn in this case).', '2008-08-25 02:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908889, 713566, 73056, '<td valign="top">I love the use of the wide angle. He has beautiful eyes.</td>', 'I love the use of the wide angle. He has beautiful eyes.', '2008-08-25 02:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908892, 713700, 3214, '<td valign="top">What a tender muzzle!  Very kissable.</td>', 'What a tender muzzle!  Very kissable.', '2008-08-25 02:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908893, 713714, 37252, '<td valign="top">I appreciate your being creative here, but the crop feels a bit awkward to me. It may be that having only the one eye showing it makes it off balance to me.</td>', 'I appreciate your being creative here, but the crop feels a bit awkward to me. It may be that having only the one eye showing it makes it off balance to me.', '2008-08-25 02:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908894, 713147, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice crop, but maybe a bit soft on focus around the eye</td>', 'Nice crop, but maybe a bit soft on focus around the eye', '2008-08-25 02:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908895, 713671, 3214, '<td valign="top">What a sweet old broodie!  Looks like a nice retirement indeed!</td>', 'What a sweet old broodie!  Looks like a nice retirement indeed!', '2008-08-25 02:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908896, 712654, 37252, '<td valign="top">tough lighting there - makes the grass a bit too bright, and yet the horse had it''s face completely in the shadows making this a bit flat.</td>', 'tough lighting there - makes the grass a bit too bright, and yet the horse had it''s face completely in the shadows making this a bit flat.', '2008-08-25 02:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908897, 712268, 83650, '<td valign="top">Frame seems a little too tight to the head - including cutting off its ears.  The eyes and nose are slightly oof.</td>', 'Frame seems a little too tight to the head - including cutting off its ears.  The eyes and nose are slightly oof.', '2008-08-25 02:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908898, 713637, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, and good title. My only suggestion for a future shot like this would be to narrow the DOF a bit so that the background is more blurred out.</td>', 'Nice shot, and good title. My only suggestion for a future shot like this would be to narrow the DOF a bit so that the background is more blurred out.', '2008-08-25 02:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908900, 713382, 37252, '<td valign="top">Color seems unnatural</td>', 'Color seems unnatural', '2008-08-25 02:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908903, 713694, 37252, '<td valign="top">Awww, a new baby. With this colt being so dark, I feel your background hurts this image. A nice green grassy background or at least something bright would really make the colt catch my eye more. The railings make this too busy, and the dirt lends to it being too dark.</td>', 'Awww, a new baby. With this colt being so dark, I feel your background hurts this image. A nice green grassy background or at least something bright would really make the colt catch my eye more. The railings make this too busy, and the dirt lends to it being too dark.', '2008-08-25 02:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908905, 713703, 37252, '<td valign="top">Harsh lighting and not enough in focus for my liking.</td>', 'Harsh lighting and not enough in focus for my liking.', '2008-08-25 02:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908906, 713505, 83650, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  But I am seeing quite a bit of noise around his eye and mane.  The background bokeh is also good.  The focus on his ear and mane seem to be a little off.  A slightly greater dof might have helped with that.</td>', 'Great capture!  But I am seeing quite a bit of noise around his eye and mane.  The background bokeh is also good.  The focus on his ear and mane seem to be a little off.  A slightly greater dof might have helped with that.', '2008-08-25 02:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908907, 713575, 37252, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus here. It really gives this shot some emotion.</td>', 'I like the soft focus here. It really gives this shot some emotion.', '2008-08-25 02:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908909, 713594, 3214, '<td valign="top">Great comp on this one...my pony wildfire waiting for me to mount, indeed.</td>', 'Great comp on this one...my pony wildfire waiting for me to mount, indeed.', '2008-08-25 02:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908910, 713174, 83650, '<td valign="top">Nice soft glow.  I believe I''ve seen this one before - if not, one very similar to it.</td>', 'Nice soft glow.  I believe I''ve seen this one before - if not, one very similar to it.', '2008-08-25 02:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908911, 712770, 37252, '<td valign="top">Beautiful horses here. I love the feeling of strength they show us as they are in excellent shape.</td>', 'Beautiful horses here. I love the feeling of strength they show us as they are in excellent shape.', '2008-08-25 02:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908913, 713654, 3214, '<td valign="top">OK, the moment they are sharing is that the guy on the right is stretching out in the preliminary posture to pee.  :-)  I like how their faces are interacting though!</td>', 'OK, the moment they are sharing is that the guy on the right is stretching out in the preliminary posture to pee.  :-)  I like how their faces are interacting though!', '2008-08-25 02:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908914, 713535, 37252, '<td valign="top">Very nice work with using natural light to back light your subject. I really expect to see this one in the top ten.</td>', 'Very nice work with using natural light to back light your subject. I really expect to see this one in the top ten.', '2008-08-25 02:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908915, 713650, 3214, '<td valign="top">We all wish we could disappear that fencing, what a cute filly!</td>', 'We all wish we could disappear that fencing, what a cute filly!', '2008-08-25 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908916, 713727, 3214, '<td valign="top">What a pretty soft focus pastoral scene!</td>', 'What a pretty soft focus pastoral scene!', '2008-08-25 02:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908917, 713732, 37252, '<td valign="top">Great action capture. I love the cowboy feel it carries to the viewer</td>', 'Great action capture. I love the cowboy feel it carries to the viewer', '2008-08-25 02:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908919, 712783, 3214, '<td valign="top">The toning is a little weird but his expression is priceless!</td>', 'The toning is a little weird but his expression is priceless!', '2008-08-25 02:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908920, 713678, 83650, '<td valign="top">Normally I could care less about that 2/3''s rule(a good shot is a good shot in my book), but having the rider high and centered in the frame makes me look at her and not the horse.</td>', 'Normally I could care less about that 2/3''s rule(a good shot is a good shot in my book), but having the rider high and centered in the frame makes me look at her and not the horse.', '2008-08-25 02:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908921, 713052, 37252, '<td valign="top">Your technicals are all good, but the crop is too tight to the head.</td>', 'Your technicals are all good, but the crop is too tight to the head.', '2008-08-25 02:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908923, 713396, 3214, '<td valign="top">Great bit of distortion here!  Truly above average!</td>', 'Great bit of distortion here!  Truly above average!', '2008-08-25 02:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908924, 713391, 37252, '<td valign="top">lol - cute title.</td>', 'lol - cute title.', '2008-08-25 02:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908925, 713540, 83650, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool.  Hard to tell how you did it.</td>', 'Pretty cool.  Hard to tell how you did it.', '2008-08-25 02:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908927, 713763, 37252, '<td valign="top">I love the title - is perfect here. I also like he perspective you shot this at.</td>', 'I love the title - is perfect here. I also like he perspective you shot this at.', '2008-08-25 02:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908931, 712877, 37252, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more horse and less background. The cluttered scenery steals the eye away from the horse.</td>', 'I would have liked to see more horse and less background. The cluttered scenery steals the eye away from the horse.', '2008-08-25 02:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908932, 712841, 3214, '<td valign="top">nice perspective, the wide angle really works for me here.</td>', 'nice perspective, the wide angle really works for me here.', '2008-08-25 02:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908933, 713668, 37252, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot....just a bit of a shoehorn entry here. lol</td>', 'Excellent shot....just a bit of a shoehorn entry here. lol', '2008-08-25 02:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908934, 713503, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - and crop</td>', 'Nice shot - and crop', '2008-08-25 02:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908935, 713576, 83650, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t have made the horse look towards the camera.  Lighting seems a little underexposed.</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t have made the horse look towards the camera.  Lighting seems a little underexposed.', '2008-08-25 02:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908936, 713542, 37252, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. Very fun and lively. I expect this will score very high</td>', 'Wonderful capture. Very fun and lively. I expect this will score very high', '2008-08-25 02:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908937, 713245, 83650, '<td valign="top">I can honestly say that I never noticed that a horse had eyelashes!</td>', 'I can honestly say that I never noticed that a horse had eyelashes!', '2008-08-25 02:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908938, 713525, 37252, '<td valign="top">Cute entry. We always see peek-a-boo shots with babies, dogs, and cats. I like that you shot this idea with a horse.</td>', 'Cute entry. We always see peek-a-boo shots with babies, dogs, and cats. I like that you shot this idea with a horse.', '2008-08-25 02:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908939, 713553, 83650, '<td valign="top">Perfect color, not overly saturated as some would have the tendency to do.  Focus on the foreground and head are perfectly balanced with the bokeh in the rear.</td>', 'Perfect color, not overly saturated as some would have the tendency to do.  Focus on the foreground and head are perfectly balanced with the bokeh in the rear.', '2008-08-25 02:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908940, 713727, 37252, '<td valign="top">Excellent work with the soft focus.</td>', 'Excellent work with the soft focus.', '2008-08-25 02:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908941, 713655, 3214, '<td valign="top">About as cute as they come!  What a sweet Icey face.</td>', 'About as cute as they come!  What a sweet Icey face.', '2008-08-25 02:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908942, 713569, 83650, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Should score rather well.</td>', 'Great capture.  Should score rather well.', '2008-08-25 02:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908943, 713310, 37252, '<td valign="top">Thank you for this perspective - it really makes it more exciting than had you shot it from the usual angle or straight on.</td>', 'Thank you for this perspective - it really makes it more exciting than had you shot it from the usual angle or straight on.', '2008-08-25 02:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908945, 713687, 3214, '<td valign="top">This looks way better at full size than in e-mail, I''m not voting either but this is surely top ten material!  Love the painterly feel.</td>', 'This looks way better at full size than in e-mail, I''m not voting either but this is surely top ten material!  Love the painterly feel.', '2008-08-25 02:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908946, 713550, 37252, '<td valign="top">Lack focus - seems blurry throughout</td>', 'Lack focus - seems blurry throughout', '2008-08-25 02:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908947, 712603, 83650, '<td valign="top">Maybe a more tightly cropped frame?  He seems very little and very centered.</td>', 'Maybe a more tightly cropped frame?  He seems very little and very centered.', '2008-08-25 02:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908948, 713553, 3214, '<td valign="top">A bit of a blue cast but what an adorable subject in an appealing setting!</td>', 'A bit of a blue cast but what an adorable subject in an appealing setting!', '2008-08-25 02:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908949, 713655, 37252, '<td valign="top">Cute horse, but oh do I get the feeling of wanting to play with that mane and a pair of scissors. :P</td>', 'Cute horse, but oh do I get the feeling of wanting to play with that mane and a pair of scissors. :P', '2008-08-25 02:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908950, 713671, 83650, '<td valign="top">I like how the sun is backlighting her - especially the mane.  The only thing I can think of to make it better is possibly cropping tighter to remove the foreground weeds/grass.</td>', 'I like how the sun is backlighting her - especially the mane.  The only thing I can think of to make it better is possibly cropping tighter to remove the foreground weeds/grass.', '2008-08-25 02:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908951, 712815, 54645, '<td valign="top">Spectacular hair. Sorry, but I could do without the human in this image ;) 7</td>', 'Spectacular hair. Sorry, but I could do without the human in this image ;) 7', '2008-08-25 02:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908952, 713245, 37252, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. I just wish you had played more with the fly to bring it out more in pp.</td>', 'I like the idea. I just wish you had played more with the fly to bring it out more in pp.', '2008-08-25 02:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908956, 713392, 83650, '<td valign="top">The contrast seems a little flat.  Instead of getting all of the riders in the shot, maybe get just a few and blow up your frame size.</td>', 'The contrast seems a little flat.  Instead of getting all of the riders in the shot, maybe get just a few and blow up your frame size.', '2008-08-25 02:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908957, 712649, 83650, '<td valign="top">Good luck. I know a lot of voters are going to hammer this because it''s not a real horse.  The dof is really nice.</td>', 'Good luck. I know a lot of voters are going to hammer this because it''s not a real horse.  The dof is really nice.', '2008-08-25 02:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908958, 713766, 83650, '<td valign="top">If I didn''t know what the challenge was, I would be scratching my head wondering exactly what this is.  Unfortunately, a lot of people are going to be looking for a horse.</td>', 'If I didn''t know what the challenge was, I would be scratching my head wondering exactly what this is.  Unfortunately, a lot of people are going to be looking for a horse.', '2008-08-25 03:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908959, 713174, 3214, '<td valign="top">Completely overprocessed into the realm of digital art, but I still like it.</td>', 'Completely overprocessed into the realm of digital art, but I still like it.', '2008-08-25 03:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908960, 713737, 83650, '<td valign="top">Nice capture with the bird. :-)  That gray sign or whatever it is in the background feels so out of place.</td>', 'Nice capture with the bird. :-)  That gray sign or whatever it is in the background feels so out of place.', '2008-08-25 03:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908961, 713687, 69668, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!!!!! A 10 from me.</td>', 'Gorgeous!!!!! A 10 from me.', '2008-08-25 03:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908962, 713012, 37252, '<td valign="top">Excellent action shot.</td>', 'Excellent action shot.', '2008-08-25 03:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908963, 713413, 3214, '<td valign="top">What a cutie, I''m enjoying how you shot from above!</td>', 'What a cutie, I''m enjoying how you shot from above!', '2008-08-25 03:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908964, 713726, 83650, '<td valign="top">I think that bumping up the "greens" saturation would have made this pop a little more.  The contrast in the background seems a little flat/hazy.  A shallower dof could have remedied that.</td>', 'I think that bumping up the "greens" saturation would have made this pop a little more.  The contrast in the background seems a little flat/hazy.  A shallower dof could have remedied that.', '2008-08-25 03:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908965, 713553, 65319, '<td valign="top">A very sweet photo.  I love the whispys of hair in the forelock and the composition of the sharp foreground with the DOF in the background...8</td>', 'A very sweet photo.  I love the whispys of hair in the forelock and the composition of the sharp foreground with the DOF in the background...8', '2008-08-25 03:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908967, 713542, 83650, '<td valign="top">This one is going to be a top 10.</td>', 'This one is going to be a top 10.', '2008-08-25 03:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908969, 713187, 83650, '<td valign="top">The ground is a bit washed out along with the upper portion of his backside.  It seems your camera may have exposed for his brown portion and hence the shutter stayed open for too long.</td>', 'The ground is a bit washed out along with the upper portion of his backside.  It seems your camera may have exposed for his brown portion and hence the shutter stayed open for too long.', '2008-08-25 03:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908973, 713760, 83650, '<td valign="top">I know you probably couldn''t do anything about it, but that dust cloud in the foreground is nasty.(makes the horses legs blurry looking)  I might have waited for a better shot that was "clean" or one that could have been cropped to not include any distracting elements.</td>', 'I know you probably couldn''t do anything about it, but that dust cloud in the foreground is nasty.(makes the horses legs blurry looking)  I might have waited for a better shot that was "clean" or one that could have been cropped to not include any distracting elements.', '2008-08-25 03:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908974, 713769, 83650, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and the colors are there - looks natural.</td>', 'Nice capture and the colors are there - looks natural.', '2008-08-25 03:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908976, 713601, 83650, '<td valign="top">The first thing I thought of when this loaded was - "Wow, yellow."  It is a very sharp capture, but the golden hue of the horse is almost too close to the color of the grass.  That''s really the only nit I have.  I''m still dropping a 7 though.</td>', 'The first thing I thought of when this loaded was - "Wow, yellow."  It is a very sharp capture, but the golden hue of the horse is almost too close to the color of the grass.  That''s really the only nit I have.  I''m still dropping a 7 though.', '2008-08-25 03:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908979, 713525, 83650, '<td valign="top">Good details, nice and sharp.  I wonder how it would have looked if the board was in focus too?</td>', 'Good details, nice and sharp.  I wonder how it would have looked if the board was in focus too?', '2008-08-25 03:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908981, 713527, 83650, '<td valign="top">Sorry to say it, but it''s shots like this that would be best not entered.  In the future, pull on in to the property and ask the owner if you can photograph their horses.</td>', 'Sorry to say it, but it''s shots like this that would be best not entered.  In the future, pull on in to the property and ask the owner if you can photograph their horses.', '2008-08-25 03:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908982, 713566, 83650, '<td valign="top">Did you dodge the eye or was it naturally that light?</td>', 'Did you dodge the eye or was it naturally that light?', '2008-08-25 03:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908983, 713396, 83650, '<td valign="top">I just laughed at this one!  That is one cool perspective.</td>', 'I just laughed at this one!  That is one cool perspective.', '2008-08-25 03:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908984, 713633, 83650, '<td valign="top">Shot at midnight, or Nik Midnight filter?</td>', 'Shot at midnight, or Nik Midnight filter?', '2008-08-25 03:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908985, 712940, 83650, '<td valign="top">The dof seems to come and go all over his face.  I do like the highkey b&amp;w though.</td>', 'The dof seems to come and go all over his face.  I do like the highkey b&w though.', '2008-08-25 03:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908987, 713702, 83650, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop surrounding the heads and jockeys would have made this shot sing.  Saturation could have used a little bump for the grass.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop surrounding the heads and jockeys would have made this shot sing.  Saturation could have used a little bump for the grass.', '2008-08-25 03:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908988, 713516, 83650, '<td valign="top">Simple and sharp with natural looking colors.</td>', 'Simple and sharp with natural looking colors.', '2008-08-25 03:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
