(4909249, 713310, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great PoV and wonderful sky as a backdrop.<br/> <br/>The timing and pose are jsut about perfect here, the only thing for me that could have made it better would be if it was shot in a meadow or pasture, so you didn''t have the empty stands in the background - but that''s just me.<br/> <br/>Lot''s of great things about this shot - well done.</td>', 'Great PoV and wonderful sky as a backdrop. The timing and pose are jsut about perfect here, the only thing for me that could have made it better would be if it was shot in a meadow or pasture, so you didn''t have the empty stands in the background - but that''s just me. Lot''s of great things about this shot - well done.', '2008-08-25 08:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
