(4909259, 713527, 51793, '<td valign="top">I think that if you wanted to make this a better shot you might have wanted to stop the car and get out. Also the lighting is off and you really can''t even see the horse(s). I think your camera focused on your mirror instead of the horse(s).</td>', 'I think that if you wanted to make this a better shot you might have wanted to stop the car and get out. Also the lighting is off and you really can''t even see the horse(s). I think your camera focused on your mirror instead of the horse(s).', '2008-08-25 08:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
