(4909816, 713512, 64610, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting and unique idea - very artistic.  The colour of the horse goes well with the white pj''s and bedding.  Perhaps a closer crop would add to the photo - I think maybe the blue sky takes away from the rest of the photo.  I also really like that the horse is nuzzled in with the girl - really lovely picture.</td>', 'This is an interesting and unique idea - very artistic.  The colour of the horse goes well with the white pj''s and bedding.  Perhaps a closer crop would add to the photo - I think maybe the blue sky takes away from the rest of the photo.  I also really like that the horse is nuzzled in with the girl - really lovely picture.', '2008-08-25 14:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
