(4910107, 712841, 83650, '<td valign="top">Seems just a little underexposed. *eta* It''s possible that your camera might have spot exposed on the light patch of the horse because the whites to the left are almost blown while the rest is muted down.</td>', 'Seems just a little underexposed. *eta* It''s possible that your camera might have spot exposed on the light patch of the horse because the whites to the left are almost blown while the rest is muted down.', '2008-08-25 16:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
