(4910142, 712264, 68586, '<td valign="top">Sweet foal who would have benefitted from a tighter crop, to lose the roof of the building behind, and maybe even black &amp; White ?</td>', 'Sweet foal who would have benefitted from a tighter crop, to lose the roof of the building behind, and maybe even black & White ?', '2008-08-25 16:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
