(4910650, 713542, 45475, '<td valign="top">....And there it is. THE shot of the challenge. Not only have you mastered colour and light here, but you''ve gone and given this animal some character with your wide angle perspective, quick thinking and brilliant interpretive title. Doesn''t get much better than this. Congratulations in advance.</td>', '....And there it is. THE shot of the challenge. Not only have you mastered colour and light here, but you''ve gone and given this animal some character with your wide angle perspective, quick thinking and brilliant interpretive title. Doesn''t get much better than this. Congratulations in advance.', '2008-08-25 20:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
