(4910687, 713164, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''d think that the blown background whites would harm this, bur for some reason they don''t affect it much.   Really good focus on the eye and the whole head of the horse.  I like the angle, too.   I wish the man rider were looking into the frame, though... but we can''t have everything, huh?   :)</td>', 'I''d think that the blown background whites would harm this, bur for some reason they don''t affect it much.   Really good focus on the eye and the whole head of the horse.  I like the angle, too.   I wish the man rider were looking into the frame, though... but we can''t have everything, huh?   :)', '2008-08-25 20:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4910688, 713727, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like the dreamy PP.  I hope everyone will.   Beautiful horse and perfect setting with that wonderful rustic fence.   Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the dreamy PP.  I hope everyone will.   Beautiful horse and perfect setting with that wonderful rustic fence.   Nicely done.', '2008-08-25 20:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4910689, 713675, 86447, '<td valign="top">A cleaner eye with a catchlight in it would up this score a bit.  But, if this isn''t your horse, I wouldn''t have cleaned the eye either.   Better safe than sorry.<br/> <br/>Nice focus on the whole face, including the sharp eye.  Well done.</td>', 'A cleaner eye with a catchlight in it would up this score a bit.  But, if this isn''t your horse, I wouldn''t have cleaned the eye either.   Better safe than sorry. Nice focus on the whole face, including the sharp eye.  Well done.', '2008-08-25 20:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4910690, 712730, 86447, '<td valign="top">It''s well done, but it''s just not ''exciting'', I think.   Perhaps if the house weren''t there it would seem more pastoral?  I don''t know...   But, I''m rambling, huh?   :)</td>', 'It''s well done, but it''s just not ''exciting'', I think.   Perhaps if the house weren''t there it would seem more pastoral?  I don''t know...   But, I''m rambling, huh?   :)', '2008-08-25 20:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
