(4911025, 712738, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love this dark moody composition. The clouds are dark and somber which creates a mood of foreboding or darkness to come. But light seems to act as a halo that gathers around the silhouette of the cowboy and to a lesser degree the horse. That gathering of light invokes the idea that out from the plains comes a ''knight in shining armor'' (or in a cowboy''s case - a knight in leather &amp; denim )to fight the darkness/evil. Ironically we think of the man dressed in black as evil while the one in white is the hero. Here in your composition the dark horse and rider through that ideal out the door because of the way you composed your shot to have the light gather around them acting as angelic halos. Love the silhouettes of the horse and rider. The pose of the horse seems to me as one that is scanning the horizon for danger while the rider turns to his faithful friend to inquire as to what irks him/her. The pose and ease of the cowboy''s stance next to the horse speaks to me of a strong comradeship. Strong composition, strong mood and dynamic tones; 9</td>', 'Love this dark moody composition. The clouds are dark and somber which creates a mood of foreboding or darkness to come. But light seems to act as a halo that gathers around the silhouette of the cowboy and to a lesser degree the horse. That gathering of light invokes the idea that out from the plains comes a ''knight in shining armor'' (or in a cowboy''s case - a knight in leather & denim )to fight the darkness/evil. Ironically we think of the man dressed in black as evil while the one in white is the hero. Here in your composition the dark horse and rider through that ideal out the door because of the way you composed your shot to have the light gather around them acting as angelic halos. Love the silhouettes of the horse and rider. The pose of the horse seems to me as one that is scanning the horizon for danger while the rider turns to his faithful friend to inquire as to what irks him/her. The pose and ease of the cowboy''s stance next to the horse speaks to me of a strong comradeship. Strong composition, strong mood and dynamic tones; 9', '2008-08-25 22:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911041, 713527, 86447, '<td valign="top">I think you should have gotten out and taken the shot... perhaps a bit closer would have made the subject more visible.  As it is, it appears to be a photograph of a vehicle.</td>', 'I think you should have gotten out and taken the shot... perhaps a bit closer would have made the subject more visible.  As it is, it appears to be a photograph of a vehicle.', '2008-08-25 22:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911042, 713730, 86447, '<td valign="top">Ummm....   I''d ''buy'' the horsepower part, but the processing of this has turned me off.  I''m sorry.</td>', 'Ummm....   I''d ''buy'' the horsepower part, but the processing of this has turned me off.  I''m sorry.', '2008-08-25 22:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911043, 712877, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wish there were more detail to the horse... The bright spots are so bright that they''re overwhelming the shadow the horse is in.   I like the composition, though.</td>', 'I wish there were more detail to the horse... The bright spots are so bright that they''re overwhelming the shadow the horse is in.   I like the composition, though.', '2008-08-25 22:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911047, 713223, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow, lovely deep tones here especially in the rich red-brown tones of the horse. The lighting is superb with the horse illuminated wonderfully so that we can look at all the lovely details of this beautiful animal. Love the sharp details you can see and appreciate from hairs in the mane to the hairs by the mouth to the horses nose and mouth. The backdrop is also rich in color and it compliments PERFECTLY your main subject. This horse is in it''s natural surroundings which has rich greens in the grass and  lovely trees for shade. Plus you have wooden fences in the backdrop which also play into the horse''s natural surroundings of him/her being raised and kept on a well tended and largely open ranch. Well composed and well done portrait of a horse; 8.</td>', 'Wow, lovely deep tones here especially in the rich red-brown tones of the horse. The lighting is superb with the horse illuminated wonderfully so that we can look at all the lovely details of this beautiful animal. Love the sharp details you can see and appreciate from hairs in the mane to the hairs by the mouth to the horses nose and mouth. The backdrop is also rich in color and it compliments PERFECTLY your main subject. This horse is in it''s natural surroundings which has rich greens in the grass and  lovely trees for shade. Plus you have wooden fences in the backdrop which also play into the horse''s natural surroundings of him/her being raised and kept on a well tended and largely open ranch. Well composed and well done portrait of a horse; 8.', '2008-08-25 22:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911051, 713714, 67152, '<td valign="top">love the bold composition</td>', 'love the bold composition', '2008-08-25 22:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911053, 713125, 86447, '<td valign="top">Since the mommy''s looking one way and the baby''s looking the other, I think this should be centered to give them equal "room to breathe".  Perhaps a bit of a crop off the left side (and maybe the bottom to even it up) would help?</td>', 'Since the mommy''s looking one way and the baby''s looking the other, I think this should be centered to give them equal "room to breathe".  Perhaps a bit of a crop off the left side (and maybe the bottom to even it up) would help?', '2008-08-25 22:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
