(4911093, 713685, 97166, '<td valign="top">Hello. I am making a point on commenting on the photos that I rated a 2 or 3 in this challenge.<br/> <br/>I gave this image a 2 for the following:<br/> <br/>For me, at this time, this is just too much of a DNMC.  It''s not even a real representation of horsepower (as thin a connection that is to horses) as it is just a gratuitous action shot. Heck, even hanging around and trying to get a nice shot of the Porsche logo would be more connective to this challenge. My feeling is that if you decide to take interpretation of a challenge this far, you deal with the consequences and one consequence is that you get a 2 from me today.<br/> <br/>Sorry.</td>', 'Hello. I am making a point on commenting on the photos that I rated a 2 or 3 in this challenge. I gave this image a 2 for the following: For me, at this time, this is just too much of a DNMC.  It''s not even a real representation of horsepower (as thin a connection that is to horses) as it is just a gratuitous action shot. Heck, even hanging around and trying to get a nice shot of the Porsche logo would be more connective to this challenge. My feeling is that if you decide to take interpretation of a challenge this far, you deal with the consequences and one consequence is that you get a 2 from me today. Sorry.', '2008-08-25 22:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
