(4911135, 713668, 97166, '<td valign="top">Hello. I am making a point on commenting on the photos that I rated a 2 or 3 in this challenge.<br/> <br/>I gave this image a 2 for the following:<br/> <br/>This is a DNMC from me.  As much as I enjoy varied interpretations on challenges, for them to score well they have to be well thought out, clever, and at least thinly relative to the subject.  This, in my opinion, is merely an action photo thrown in hoping to get some kind of wow factor vote, with the only relativity being the word "horse".  To me, it''s a cheap and quick way to enter a challenge for the sake of entering a challenge.<br/> <br/>With this kind of choice, come chances. On this draw, you got a 2.</td>', 'Hello. I am making a point on commenting on the photos that I rated a 2 or 3 in this challenge. I gave this image a 2 for the following: This is a DNMC from me.  As much as I enjoy varied interpretations on challenges, for them to score well they have to be well thought out, clever, and at least thinly relative to the subject.  This, in my opinion, is merely an action photo thrown in hoping to get some kind of wow factor vote, with the only relativity being the word "horse".  To me, it''s a cheap and quick way to enter a challenge for the sake of entering a challenge. With this kind of choice, come chances. On this draw, you got a 2.', '2008-08-25 23:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911140, 713396, 93478, '<td valign="top">Horsey indeed!  Great choice of wide angle with the brown face.  It almost looks like the head belongs to a different animal.  Popping the green a little more would get you more votes, IMO.</td>', 'Horsey indeed!  Great choice of wide angle with the brown face.  It almost looks like the head belongs to a different animal.  Popping the green a little more would get you more votes, IMO.', '2008-08-25 23:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
