(4911164, 713730, 97166, '<td valign="top">Hello. I am making a point on commenting on the photos that I rated a 2 or 3 in this challenge.<br/> <br/>I gave this image a 2 for the following:<br/> <br/>As with the other photos in this challenge that were based on this subject, I just don''t feel that it is a clever enough interpretation to warrant a higher score.  Horsepower may have been based on horses at one time in the past, but today it speaks of vehicles.  For me, challenges are there for a reason, to challenge. I believe if we were to allow interpretation this wide-spread, every challenge may as well be a free study.<br/> <br/>So, with that in mind, this image warrants a 2 from me.  Perhaps you are faring better with other voters.</td>', 'Hello. I am making a point on commenting on the photos that I rated a 2 or 3 in this challenge. I gave this image a 2 for the following: As with the other photos in this challenge that were based on this subject, I just don''t feel that it is a clever enough interpretation to warrant a higher score.  Horsepower may have been based on horses at one time in the past, but today it speaks of vehicles.  For me, challenges are there for a reason, to challenge. I believe if we were to allow interpretation this wide-spread, every challenge may as well be a free study. So, with that in mind, this image warrants a 2 from me.  Perhaps you are faring better with other voters.', '2008-08-25 23:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
