(4911404, 713065, 83650, '<td valign="top">The image of the horse is very strong, sharp, and shows excellent colors.  I''m not so crazy about that bush to the left though.</td>', 'The image of the horse is very strong, sharp, and shows excellent colors.  I''m not so crazy about that bush to the left though.', '2008-08-26 00:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911405, 713582, 83650, '<td valign="top">What a trip - I''m second guessing myself trying to imagine this guy is for real!  I think it has to do with his "hair."  That mop on his head is hilarious.</td>', 'What a trip - I''m second guessing myself trying to imagine this guy is for real!  I think it has to do with his "hair."  That mop on his head is hilarious.', '2008-08-26 00:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911407, 713550, 83650, '<td valign="top">Seems too orange(oversaturated?), focus is on the wrong part of his body or your aperture was way open.</td>', 'Seems too orange(oversaturated?), focus is on the wrong part of his body or your aperture was way open.', '2008-08-26 01:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911409, 713662, 83650, '<td valign="top">Overall it''s good.  You even had a fast enough shutter speed to stop the tail whipping around.</td>', 'Overall it''s good.  You even had a fast enough shutter speed to stop the tail whipping around.', '2008-08-26 01:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911413, 713550, 71244, '<td valign="top">the moment is sweet here but the out of focus is so distracting.</td>', 'the moment is sweet here but the out of focus is so distracting.', '2008-08-26 01:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911415, 713768, 83650, '<td valign="top">Contrast on the landscape seems just a little bit flat.  A faster shutter speed/higer iso may have helped too with the horse''s motion.</td>', 'Contrast on the landscape seems just a little bit flat.  A faster shutter speed/higer iso may have helped too with the horse''s motion.', '2008-08-26 01:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
