(4911422, 713708, 83650, '<td valign="top">I like that I see the horse''s head first and not the rider.  To me, the rider seems secondary - which is good.  I can see just a little bit of movement on the gear near the mouth - not much, but a little faster shutter speed/higher iso would have stopped that.</td>', 'I like that I see the horse''s head first and not the rider.  To me, the rider seems secondary - which is good.  I can see just a little bit of movement on the gear near the mouth - not much, but a little faster shutter speed/higher iso would have stopped that.', '2008-08-26 01:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911428, 713734, 83650, '<td valign="top">There''s something in this that looks like noise to me.  Maybe not, but his right ear either twitched very quickly or a noise reduction pass blurred/softened it out.</td>', 'There''s something in this that looks like noise to me.  Maybe not, but his right ear either twitched very quickly or a noise reduction pass blurred/softened it out.', '2008-08-26 01:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911431, 712197, 82707, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting!  I love the softness of this image!</td>', 'Beautiful lighting!  I love the softness of this image!', '2008-08-26 01:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911434, 712730, 83650, '<td valign="top">Maybe moving to the left and getting rid of the house and power pole would have made the horse stand out a little better.  The large dof makes me wander all over the shot instead of the horse - try a larger aperture.</td>', 'Maybe moving to the left and getting rid of the house and power pole would have made the horse stand out a little better.  The large dof makes me wander all over the shot instead of the horse - try a larger aperture.', '2008-08-26 01:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911437, 713595, 83650, '<td valign="top">To be honest, there''s a lot to look at here.  I''m first drawn to the red shirt, then the barns, the cars, and then finally back to the horse.  Maybe moving to another location with just the trees in the background would have kept the interest on the horse a little better.</td>', 'To be honest, there''s a lot to look at here.  I''m first drawn to the red shirt, then the barns, the cars, and then finally back to the horse.  Maybe moving to another location with just the trees in the background would have kept the interest on the horse a little better.', '2008-08-26 01:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911438, 713650, 82707, '<td valign="top">Nice image! Lovely composition and colour!  ...IMO the fences in the background are a bit distracting from an otherwise great image. Good luck!</td>', 'Nice image! Lovely composition and colour!  ...IMO the fences in the background are a bit distracting from an otherwise great image. Good luck!', '2008-08-26 01:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911439, 713153, 45475, '<td valign="top">Like a fantastic dream...</td>', 'Like a fantastic dream...', '2008-08-26 01:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911441, 713611, 83650, '<td valign="top">I know he''s probably looking right at the camera, but it doesn''t show up very well.  If you had shot his eyes more clearly, it may had been more interesting.</td>', 'I know he''s probably looking right at the camera, but it doesn''t show up very well.  If you had shot his eyes more clearly, it may had been more interesting.', '2008-08-26 01:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911442, 713677, 83650, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t mind underexposed shots if they work well, but this could have used a *slight* bump in that department.  The centered eye is, well, a bit too centered.  Maybe move the crop around a little bit and get some defining features of his face.</td>', 'Normally I don''t mind underexposed shots if they work well, but this could have used a *slight* bump in that department.  The centered eye is, well, a bit too centered.  Maybe move the crop around a little bit and get some defining features of his face.', '2008-08-26 01:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911443, 712738, 83650, '<td valign="top">I love it - the only thing I wish you could have done differently was put more of the horse in the frame and move the man over to the side a little bit.  Cropping as a square just to the right of his shoulder would have also looked sweet.</td>', 'I love it - the only thing I wish you could have done differently was put more of the horse in the frame and move the man over to the side a little bit.  Cropping as a square just to the right of his shoulder would have also looked sweet.', '2008-08-26 01:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911447, 713771, 83650, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of the blur or glow filter from this angle.  From a distance it might have looked good, but close up....eh.</td>', 'Not a big fan of the blur or glow filter from this angle.  From a distance it might have looked good, but close up....eh.', '2008-08-26 01:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911450, 713650, 83650, '<td valign="top">Good capture, good colors on the horse.  The fore/backgound colors are in need of a good contrast/saturation adjustment.</td>', 'Good capture, good colors on the horse.  The fore/backgound colors are in need of a good contrast/saturation adjustment.', '2008-08-26 01:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911454, 712536, 83650, '<td valign="top">Focus seems off up and down across the image.  There are also major jpg artifacts present throughout the photo.  The image size is only 20kB - you are allowed up to 200kB.  That alone would have eliminated most if not all of the jpg compression artifacts.</td>', 'Focus seems off up and down across the image.  There are also major jpg artifacts present throughout the photo.  The image size is only 20kB - you are allowed up to 200kB.  That alone would have eliminated most if not all of the jpg compression artifacts.', '2008-08-26 01:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911456, 713681, 83650, '<td valign="top">Guessing this is a statue of some sort?  Not sure what that blue outline is from - added in pp?</td>', 'Guessing this is a statue of some sort?  Not sure what that blue outline is from - added in pp?', '2008-08-26 01:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
