(4912187, 713530, 36999, '<td valign="top">Where''d you find one of those rare yellow and black zebras?!?   (light reflecting off the grass)  The big branch under his neck is a bit distracting.  Nice &amp; sharp focus, good DOF.  Would be a bit more dynamic if you had cropped it off center.  Zebras are pretty cool creatures.</td>', 'Where''d you find one of those rare yellow and black zebras?!?   (light reflecting off the grass)  The big branch under his neck is a bit distracting.  Nice & sharp focus, good DOF.  Would be a bit more dynamic if you had cropped it off center.  Zebras are pretty cool creatures.', '2008-08-26 14:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912190, 712738, 36999, '<td valign="top">NIce drama.  I would have liked to seen the clouds  wee bit more lighter than they are, not in the center but slightly out from the center just to show more detail in them and make the silhouette pop out a little more. A square crop also might have enhanced the silhouetted subject.  Seems a bit more room on the right than needed.</td>', 'NIce drama.  I would have liked to seen the clouds  wee bit more lighter than they are, not in the center but slightly out from the center just to show more detail in them and make the silhouette pop out a little more. A square crop also might have enhanced the silhouetted subject.  Seems a bit more room on the right than needed.', '2008-08-26 14:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912197, 713569, 36999, '<td valign="top">You chopped off his feet!  Nice color and DOF.  A dignified old man too (notice the sway in his back)  Bet he gets more roan every year.  The horses in the BG tell some of the story but it would have been more ideal if they had been smaller (further away) YOu can also squat down or walked down the hill, to move the horizon line down which would have hidden them a bit more and maybe even shown their grazing head under his belly.  That also would have retrieved his feet for ya.</td>', 'You chopped off his feet!  Nice color and DOF.  A dignified old man too (notice the sway in his back)  Bet he gets more roan every year.  The horses in the BG tell some of the story but it would have been more ideal if they had been smaller (further away) YOu can also squat down or walked down the hill, to move the horizon line down which would have hidden them a bit more and maybe even shown their grazing head under his belly.  That also would have retrieved his feet for ya.', '2008-08-26 14:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912204, 713655, 36999, '<td valign="top">HaHa!  Looks like someone trimmed his bangs!  (forelock)  The crop:  he needed to be cropped either tighter or more open.  I want to see the rest of his whiskers and his ears needed to either be cropped completely out or be all there.  Mid-ear crop is buggin.    Lovely exposure and love the eyes and their eye-lights.  Nice and crisp too.</td>', 'HaHa!  Looks like someone trimmed his bangs!  (forelock)  The crop:  he needed to be cropped either tighter or more open.  I want to see the rest of his whiskers and his ears needed to either be cropped completely out or be all there.  Mid-ear crop is buggin.    Lovely exposure and love the eyes and their eye-lights.  Nice and crisp too.', '2008-08-26 14:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912210, 713507, 36999, '<td valign="top">I like the treatment except for the color.  waaayyy too yellow for me.  nice composition and the fence in the BG doesn''t even bother me much it gives it a sense of place.  Losing the mud spots would have been a bonus too.  nice DOF and crisp</td>', 'I like the treatment except for the color.  waaayyy too yellow for me.  nice composition and the fence in the BG doesn''t even bother me much it gives it a sense of place.  Losing the mud spots would have been a bonus too.  nice DOF and crisp', '2008-08-26 14:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912213, 713553, 36999, '<td valign="top">Cute litte guy with his curly fur!  great color and DOF.  I would have liked to seen more of his neck so he wouldn''t be such a floating head</td>', 'Cute litte guy with his curly fur!  great color and DOF.  I would have liked to seen more of his neck so he wouldn''t be such a floating head', '2008-08-26 14:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912217, 713675, 36999, '<td valign="top">shot with a wide lens.  huge head teeny body.  Horses are hard in this respect.  way too easy to distort , a much longer focal length fixes this (like over 100mm)  If you intend to distort them it''s good to make it really obvious, humorously obvious.  too much NI kills off the texture in his hair.  nice color and good that you got his ears up.</td>', 'shot with a wide lens.  huge head teeny body.  Horses are hard in this respect.  way too easy to distort , a much longer focal length fixes this (like over 100mm)  If you intend to distort them it''s good to make it really obvious, humorously obvious.  too much NI kills off the texture in his hair.  nice color and good that you got his ears up.', '2008-08-26 14:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912226, 713289, 36999, '<td valign="top">no vote  but drop dead gorgeous image.  I appreciate the difficulty in getting a shot like this.  a rare image that you have mastered.  Love the drama in the light and so amazing that you kept the shady-side eye-light and the highlights on the body so well.  A true master of horse images.</td>', 'no vote  but drop dead gorgeous image.  I appreciate the difficulty in getting a shot like this.  a rare image that you have mastered.  Love the drama in the light and so amazing that you kept the shady-side eye-light and the highlights on the body so well.  A true master of horse images.', '2008-08-26 14:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912233, 713725, 36999, '<td valign="top">nice interesting crop, I do miss the eye tho.  If there were even just an eye-light to show it''s placement it would have been great.  I like the toning</td>', 'nice interesting crop, I do miss the eye tho.  If there were even just an eye-light to show it''s placement it would have been great.  I like the toning', '2008-08-26 14:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912240, 713153, 36999, '<td valign="top">this is gorgeous.  It''s really, really hard to do such a lovely motion blur of a horse, smearing it, yet keeping the horseness.  I love the muted colors in this.  My only suggestion would have been a crop that had it running  level or slightly "uphill" instead of down. (referring to the body, not the horizon, shoulders higher or level to hips)</td>', 'this is gorgeous.  It''s really, really hard to do such a lovely motion blur of a horse, smearing it, yet keeping the horseness.  I love the muted colors in this.  My only suggestion would have been a crop that had it running  level or slightly "uphill" instead of down. (referring to the body, not the horizon, shoulders higher or level to hips)', '2008-08-26 14:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912249, 713678, 36999, '<td valign="top">very nice except for a few small things,  A fraction of a second later in the stride would have made his front legs a bit more attractive.  They kind of look like they are just dangling instead of working.   an off center crop would have given it a little more dynacism (is that a word?) Ears up is always a bonus.  NIce, exposure, color, and focus.</td>', 'very nice except for a few small things,  A fraction of a second later in the stride would have made his front legs a bit more attractive.  They kind of look like they are just dangling instead of working.   an off center crop would have given it a little more dynacism (is that a word?) Ears up is always a bonus.  NIce, exposure, color, and focus.', '2008-08-26 14:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912252, 713591, 36999, '<td valign="top">I want to see his ear tip!  a bit dark and oversharpened, good DOF</td>', 'I want to see his ear tip!  a bit dark and oversharpened, good DOF', '2008-08-26 14:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912260, 713611, 36999, '<td valign="top">Your horse needs it ''s bridal path to grow out!  (or re trimmed)  He''s a cutie.  I want to see a bit more room under his nose and less over his head.  too much dead space on the right as well.</td>', 'Your horse needs it ''s bridal path to grow out!  (or re trimmed)  He''s a cutie.  I want to see a bit more room under his nose and less over his head.  too much dead space on the right as well.', '2008-08-26 14:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912263, 713738, 36999, '<td valign="top">nice comp, DOF and toning.  a bit more contrast is the only thing I want for in this pic.  great eye lights!</td>', 'nice comp, DOF and toning.  a bit more contrast is the only thing I want for in this pic.  great eye lights!', '2008-08-26 14:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912266, 713550, 36999, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the frame, neat composition, I miss his ear tip a little and I sure wish the horse and girls faces are what was in focus instead of the horses shoulder.</td>', 'I don''t care for the frame, neat composition, I miss his ear tip a little and I sure wish the horse and girls faces are what was in focus instead of the horses shoulder.', '2008-08-26 15:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912274, 712815, 36999, '<td valign="top">Man, this could have been great!  except for the dude in the t-shirt.  awesome horse, awesome action, awesome mane, awesome crop.  but the t-shirt kills it for me.  if the rider had been in traditional dress with a hat, OMG!!!!!!  (even any shirt with a collar would have rocked)</td>', 'Man, this could have been great!  except for the dude in the t-shirt.  awesome horse, awesome action, awesome mane, awesome crop.  but the t-shirt kills it for me.  if the rider had been in traditional dress with a hat, OMG!!!!!!  (even any shirt with a collar would have rocked)', '2008-08-26 15:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912276, 713223, 36999, '<td valign="top">the horse doesn''t look too amused.  needs ears up.  nice color, a wee bit more light on his face would have helped too</td>', 'the horse doesn''t look too amused.  needs ears up.  nice color, a wee bit more light on his face would have helped too', '2008-08-26 15:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912279, 713769, 36999, '<td valign="top">nice color funny that all were facing the other direction but 2.  Usually it''s half and half when the band together to help with pest control (flies)  nice image</td>', 'nice color funny that all were facing the other direction but 2.  Usually it''s half and half when the band together to help with pest control (flies)  nice image', '2008-08-26 15:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912306, 713527, 3746, '<td valign="top">sorry but this seems like its been entered for the sake of it.. its dark, its snapshotty, the subject is barely there, no thought has gone into the composition.. sorry, but this could well finish in the bottom 5.</td>', 'sorry but this seems like its been entered for the sake of it.. its dark, its snapshotty, the subject is barely there, no thought has gone into the composition.. sorry, but this could well finish in the bottom 5.', '2008-08-26 15:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912307, 713503, 3746, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and do I detect a slight hint of EHDR in there as well? Not a bad effort at all.</td>', 'Nice composition, and do I detect a slight hint of EHDR in there as well? Not a bad effort at all.', '2008-08-26 15:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912309, 713310, 3746, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. The exposure is bang on throughout, this is only the 3rd shot I have voted on this challenge but it will take some beating. well done.</td>', 'Fantastic shot. The exposure is bang on throughout, this is only the 3rd shot I have voted on this challenge but it will take some beating. well done.', '2008-08-26 15:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
