(4912537, 713177, 32378, '<td valign="top">A less busy background and shallower depth of field would help this shot.  All the highlights in the back gound are somewhat distracting.  Some nice fill flash would have helped too to get some light into the eye and give it a catch light. Try to get pictures of horses with thier ears pointing forward.</td>', 'A less busy background and shallower depth of field would help this shot.  All the highlights in the back gound are somewhat distracting.  Some nice fill flash would have helped too to get some light into the eye and give it a catch light. Try to get pictures of horses with thier ears pointing forward.', '2008-08-26 16:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912555, 712708, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, however the forground seems over exposed and would have liked to see more of the face of the horse on the right or better yet changed your point of view so only the horse on the left was in the scene.</td>', 'Nice idea, however the forground seems over exposed and would have liked to see more of the face of the horse on the right or better yet changed your point of view so only the horse on the left was in the scene.', '2008-08-26 17:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
