(4918622, 713649, 73056, '<td valign="top">AHH.. I could kiss him on the nose. He reminds me of my horse up close.</td>', 'AHH.. I could kiss him on the nose. He reminds me of my horse up close.', '2008-08-28 22:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4918625, 713052, 73056, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. Looks like he could use a bath.</td>', 'Nice portrait. Looks like he could use a bath.', '2008-08-28 22:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4918626, 713164, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, excellent expressions from both your pimary and secondary subjects.</td>', 'Great perspective, excellent expressions from both your pimary and secondary subjects.', '2008-08-28 22:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4918627, 712783, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely portrait.  Wonderful detail and a great look from the horse, and a very good supporting background.</td>', 'This is a lovely portrait.  Wonderful detail and a great look from the horse, and a very good supporting background.', '2008-08-28 22:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4918629, 713768, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great angle and love the way you caught what I assume is the instructor under the horse''s legs.  Nifty shot!</td>', 'Great angle and love the way you caught what I assume is the instructor under the horse''s legs.  Nifty shot!', '2008-08-28 22:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4918630, 712197, 30982, '<td valign="top">Makes one almost believe in unicorns.  Lovely processing.</td>', 'Makes one almost believe in unicorns.  Lovely processing.', '2008-08-28 22:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4918631, 712677, 30982, '<td valign="top">And yet another great title!  Lovely idea and a very cooperative model!</td>', 'And yet another great title!  Lovely idea and a very cooperative model!', '2008-08-28 22:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4918632, 713655, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great bangs!  And love the direct approach you took with this very entertaining and well shot portrait.</td>', 'Great bangs!  And love the direct approach you took with this very entertaining and well shot portrait.', '2008-08-28 22:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4918922, 713527, 33672, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing but needs a levels adjustment.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-01 13:31:20.</i></td>', 'Interesting framing but needs a levels adjustment.', '2008-08-29 00:59:19.000000', '2008-09-01 14:31:20.000000', 1),
(4918928, 712603, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great work here. Really nice. Great POV and DOF control.</td>', 'Great work here. Really nice. Great POV and DOF control.', '2008-08-29 01:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4918941, 713505, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great capture. And a contender.</td>', 'Great capture. And a contender.', '2008-08-29 01:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4918942, 713569, 33672, '<td valign="top">This is very well composed.</td>', 'This is very well composed.', '2008-08-29 01:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4918971, 713542, 70000, '<td valign="top">It looks like it''s singing! How fun! Great background and lighting too. Very nice, and different.</td>', 'It looks like it''s singing! How fun! Great background and lighting too. Very nice, and different.', '2008-08-29 01:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4918975, 713503, 70000, '<td valign="top">I love how the angle makes the head of the zebra kind of blend in. Great tones in the background, maybe a bit oversharpened but fun image.</td>', 'I love how the angle makes the head of the zebra kind of blend in. Great tones in the background, maybe a bit oversharpened but fun image.', '2008-08-29 01:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4918977, 713540, 70000, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! flighty, vintage, abstract, fun. I love this!</td>', 'Wonderful! flighty, vintage, abstract, fun. I love this!', '2008-08-29 01:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4918981, 713310, 70000, '<td valign="top">Impressive angle. I like the effect of the wide angle and the fact that the shadows are not too harsh even though this is in direct sunlight. Nicely done</td>', 'Impressive angle. I like the effect of the wide angle and the fact that the shadows are not too harsh even though this is in direct sunlight. Nicely done', '2008-08-29 01:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4918984, 712940, 70000, '<td valign="top">Strange, strained look for the horse. I love the tones and I wish that dpc would allow more width for this to have better impact. Lovely black and white tones on this. Very unique! I like the style of this.</td>', 'Strange, strained look for the horse. I love the tones and I wish that dpc would allow more width for this to have better impact. Lovely black and white tones on this. Very unique! I like the style of this.', '2008-08-29 01:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919643, 713542, 97049, '<td valign="top">Class.  Very funny caption and brill photo</td>', 'Class.  Very funny caption and brill photo', '2008-08-29 12:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919658, 713174, 62187, '<td valign="top">I can''t add anything ''helpful'' - it looks like you''ve got photography down to a ''T''. I can tell you I think your photo is truly beautiful and I think it will win the Blue Ribbon. It''s a 10 all the way!</td>', 'I can''t add anything ''helpful'' - it looks like you''ve got photography down to a ''T''. I can tell you I think your photo is truly beautiful and I think it will win the Blue Ribbon. It''s a 10 all the way!', '2008-08-29 12:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919662, 713542, 62187, '<td valign="top">I can''t offer anything ''helpful'' to your photo - it''s perfect as I see it. I''m scoring it a 10 and I think it should place in the top 10 for sure but I''m really thinking it will get the Red Ribbon.</td>', 'I can''t offer anything ''helpful'' to your photo - it''s perfect as I see it. I''m scoring it a 10 and I think it should place in the top 10 for sure but I''m really thinking it will get the Red Ribbon.', '2008-08-29 12:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919668, 713012, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve done an excellent job. It looks like low lighting with motion but you''ve captured a very sharp image - well done in my book. It''s a 10 of course. I think it should be the top winner but I really think two other photos will beat it because they are more colorful. Yours should be placed ahead due to difficulty. Anyway, good luck to you &amp; Rio - I think he will finish 3rd but he''s tops to me!</td>', 'I think you''ve done an excellent job. It looks like low lighting with motion but you''ve captured a very sharp image - well done in my book. It''s a 10 of course. I think it should be the top winner but I really think two other photos will beat it because they are more colorful. Yours should be placed ahead due to difficulty. Anyway, good luck to you & Rio - I think he will finish 3rd but he''s tops to me!', '2008-08-29 12:55:49.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4919672, 712197, 62187, '<td valign="top">I really like your photo and am scoring it a 10. I think it will finish in the top 10. It looks like a little ''halo'' effect going on around the top of the horses head but not too bad at all - maybe even unnoticeable to some? Or maybe my eyes are looking at things that aren''t there? Anyway - 10!</td>', 'I really like your photo and am scoring it a 10. I think it will finish in the top 10. It looks like a little ''halo'' effect going on around the top of the horses head but not too bad at all - maybe even unnoticeable to some? Or maybe my eyes are looking at things that aren''t there? Anyway - 10!', '2008-08-29 12:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919673, 712940, 62187, '<td valign="top">Your image suggests the feeling of power to me. I''m scoring it a 10 and hope it will finish in the top 10.</td>', 'Your image suggests the feeling of power to me. I''m scoring it a 10 and hope it will finish in the top 10.', '2008-08-29 12:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919674, 713575, 62187, '<td valign="top">An excellent photo - lighting, contrast and color are perfect. The soft vignette is nice. There are some bright spots in the dark trees I think could have been cloned/blurred out but regardless, I''m still scoring your photo a 10. I think it should place in the top 10 as well.</td>', 'An excellent photo - lighting, contrast and color are perfect. The soft vignette is nice. There are some bright spots in the dark trees I think could have been cloned/blurred out but regardless, I''m still scoring your photo a 10. I think it should place in the top 10 as well.', '2008-08-29 13:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919677, 713164, 62187, '<td valign="top">It looks like the horses name is ''Max X''. ''X'' is of course, ''Ten'' in Roman Numerals. Fitting because it''s a 10 of a photo. The editing process is really nice to me - very 3D-ish. I think your photo will certainly place well within the top ten and possibly a ribbon winner.</td>', 'It looks like the horses name is ''Max X''. ''X'' is of course, ''Ten'' in Roman Numerals. Fitting because it''s a 10 of a photo. The editing process is really nice to me - very 3D-ish. I think your photo will certainly place well within the top ten and possibly a ribbon winner.', '2008-08-29 13:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919682, 713727, 62187, '<td valign="top">There is a quality in your photo that I can''t place my finger on but I really like it. The colors are not harsh and almost drab, it''s very soft yet sharp at the same time and there is no action. Yet, it''s a 10 to me. I''m hoping it will finish in the top 10.</td>', 'There is a quality in your photo that I can''t place my finger on but I really like it. The colors are not harsh and almost drab, it''s very soft yet sharp at the same time and there is no action. Yet, it''s a 10 to me. I''m hoping it will finish in the top 10.', '2008-08-29 13:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919683, 713772, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very cute. I like the contrast but slightly backlit maybe? Anyway, I''m giving it a 10 and I hope it finishes in the top 10.</td>', 'Very cute. I like the contrast but slightly backlit maybe? Anyway, I''m giving it a 10 and I hope it finishes in the top 10.', '2008-08-29 13:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919684, 713708, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not one of my favorite photos of the challenge but it''s a very, very good photo. I think it should do very well, top 10 at least and even though it''s not a favorite of mine, I''m still scoring it a 10. Good luck to ya! Oh, if that''s your horse, who''s that riding it? };&gt;)</td>', 'Not one of my favorite photos of the challenge but it''s a very, very good photo. I think it should do very well, top 10 at least and even though it''s not a favorite of mine, I''m still scoring it a 10. Good luck to ya! Oh, if that''s your horse, who''s that riding it? };>)', '2008-08-29 13:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
