(4920728, 713703, 45524, '<td valign="top">I dont like to vote low without a comment, so I''m going to tell you, why. The colors, the clarity and the composition just dont work for me.</td>', 'I dont like to vote low without a comment, so I''m going to tell you, why. The colors, the clarity and the composition just dont work for me.', '2008-08-29 23:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
