(4924675, 713542, 28029, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on well deserved Blue. Great shot, great title, great photographer.</td>', 'Congratulations on well deserved Blue. Great shot, great title, great photographer.', '2008-09-01 06:27:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4924680, 713514, 90924, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, beautiful subject.  Good angle to show the profile, width between the eyes (both characteristics of this breed of horse).  Love that you caught the "catch light" in the eye.<br/> <br/>Something about the lower lip bothers me;  I''m left wondering if the horse was in the process of licking, or if it may have a slight underbite?</td>', 'Nice portrait, beautiful subject.  Good angle to show the profile, width between the eyes (both characteristics of this breed of horse).  Love that you caught the "catch light" in the eye. Something about the lower lip bothers me;  I''m left wondering if the horse was in the process of licking, or if it may have a slight underbite?', '2008-09-01 06:29:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4924705, 713530, 90924, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  I like that you shot him from below his level.<br/> <br/>I find myself wishing that the white portions of the subject''s coat didn''t have a color cast to it, and also that the tree trunk wasn''t "growing" out of it''s back and into the jaw.<br/> <br/>I think that had there been a bit more light on the near side of the face and a catch light in the eye, it might have helped to bring a point of focus to the image.</td>', 'Nice subject.  I like that you shot him from below his level. I find myself wishing that the white portions of the subject''s coat didn''t have a color cast to it, and also that the tree trunk wasn''t "growing" out of it''s back and into the jaw. I think that had there been a bit more light on the near side of the face and a catch light in the eye, it might have helped to bring a point of focus to the image.', '2008-09-01 06:37:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4924722, 713649, 60614, '<td valign="top">Wow I was curious to see which one was yours.  I can''t believe people gave this such a low score.  I gave it 6 but if I can go through again I most likely would have bumped it up.  This is a very nice portrait and nothing to be ashamed of.</td>', 'Wow I was curious to see which one was yours.  I can''t believe people gave this such a low score.  I gave it 6 but if I can go through again I most likely would have bumped it up.  This is a very nice portrait and nothing to be ashamed of.', '2008-09-01 06:43:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4924869, 713553, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow - congrats!!  Just something you went out and shot last minute, eh?  Very nice!</td>', 'Wow - congrats!!  Just something you went out and shot last minute, eh?  Very nice!', '2008-09-01 07:52:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4924871, 713714, 30982, '<td valign="top">You got a 10 from me, and I don''t hand those out all that often.  Great job with this - perfect for the challenge and one of my favorites.</td>', 'You got a 10 from me, and I don''t hand those out all that often.  Great job with this - perfect for the challenge and one of my favorites.', '2008-09-01 07:54:12.000000', NULL, 0),
