(4924905, 713573, 30982, '<td valign="top">Kindly don''t let low scores get to you - you have a delightfully fun style that we don''t see a lot of around DPC.  Well, we do, but then folks tend to get discouraged and wander off.  This was one of my favorites of the challenge as far as content.  It does need a bit of tweaking in post processing to really bring it out - you may want to subject yourself to the hordes by posting this in a forum and asking for processing tips and guidance.  And keep shooting!</td>', 'Kindly don''t let low scores get to you - you have a delightfully fun style that we don''t see a lot of around DPC.  Well, we do, but then folks tend to get discouraged and wander off.  This was one of my favorites of the challenge as far as content.  It does need a bit of tweaking in post processing to really bring it out - you may want to subject yourself to the hordes by posting this in a forum and asking for processing tips and guidance.  And keep shooting!', '2008-09-01 08:13:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4924908, 713028, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful animal, excellent detail, and beautiful presentation here - congrats on getting a new one in your top row, and of a subject that''s near and dear to your heart!</td>', 'Beautiful animal, excellent detail, and beautiful presentation here - congrats on getting a new one in your top row, and of a subject that''s near and dear to your heart!', '2008-09-01 08:15:56.000000', NULL, 0),
