(4925746, 713535, 86447, '<td valign="top">Yup.   A beautiful red ribbon for a stunning photograph.<br/> <br/>I still like my title better, though.  *grin*</td>', 'Yup.   A beautiful red ribbon for a stunning photograph. I still like my title better, though.  *grin*', '2008-09-01 14:21:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4925747, 713730, 50641, '<td valign="top">When they announced the challenge, I''d hoped for a few horsepower shots :)  I really like the textures here - it''s an interesting twist on the usual gleamy chromey stuff.  I like your title too - reminds me of my grandfather.  He''d say, "Ya wanna hear a dirty joke?  Yeah?  40 white horses ran through the mud!"  Well, he''d only gotten it half right but he''d laugh like hell anyway ;-)  Congrats on getting the Tan! (very close to brown)  Badge of honor in these parts.</td>', 'When they announced the challenge, I''d hoped for a few horsepower shots :)  I really like the textures here - it''s an interesting twist on the usual gleamy chromey stuff.  I like your title too - reminds me of my grandfather.  He''d say, "Ya wanna hear a dirty joke?  Yeah?  40 white horses ran through the mud!"  Well, he''d only gotten it half right but he''d laugh like hell anyway ;-)  Congrats on getting the Tan! (very close to brown)  Badge of honor in these parts.', '2008-09-01 14:21:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4925752, 712971, 59029, '<td valign="top">Could you do me a huge favour and find out who made this carousel?  I''m guessing Stein and Goldstein, but may have also been Phildelphia Toboggan Company.  Thanks!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-01 13:23:36.</i></td>', 'Could you do me a huge favour and find out who made this carousel?  I''m guessing Stein and Goldstein, but may have also been Phildelphia Toboggan Company.  Thanks!', '2008-09-01 14:22:40.000000', '2008-09-01 14:23:36.000000', 0),
(4925770, 713382, 50641, '<td valign="top">I like the crop alot.  Enjoy the texture too - that and the vivid peach and touches of cyan make this more of a stylized interpretation than a clinical assessment - which is plenty fine by me! This picture would look grand hanging in a green room.  Favorite part of all is those eyelashes!</td>', 'I like the crop alot.  Enjoy the texture too - that and the vivid peach and touches of cyan make this more of a stylized interpretation than a clinical assessment - which is plenty fine by me! This picture would look grand hanging in a green room.  Favorite part of all is those eyelashes!', '2008-09-01 14:26:35.000000', NULL, 0),
