(4933480, 713535, 35720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nutzito:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jutilda:</b></div><hr/><i> Icelandic horses are so awesome. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I assume this is an "Icelandic" horse then.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon with this beautiful shot. Even more congrats for taking 1st and 2nd along with your brother. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes Alfredo, this is the Icelandic horse.<br/>Many thanks for your kind words.</td>', 'Originally posted by nutzito: Originally posted by Jutilda: Icelandic horses are so awesome.   I assume this is an "Icelandic" horse then. Congrats on the ribbon with this beautiful shot. Even more congrats for taking 1st and 2nd along with your brother.   Yes Alfredo, this is the Icelandic horse.Many thanks for your kind words.', '2008-09-04 05:26:09.000000', NULL, 0),
